    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91279.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "My absolute pleasure. One thing you get criticized about is, hey, was this guy ever do for Iowa? We could get into all that, but I don't want to get into all that right now. Because what we can talk about right now is the $2.8 billion agricultural deal that's just been done with Taiwan. And you had a role in",
