        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener will recognize the significance of the Taiwan agricultural deal and its implications.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes they have legitimate grounds to reference the deal as evidence of the listener’s impact.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener values recognition of current accomplishments over historical performance.",
