    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91279.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "You do. You always smile, always got a handshake for me. So this, I mean, this is really a bit. Is this a big deal? I mean, it sounds like a big deal. you're talking to someone that doesn't know a lot about agriculture. I freely admit that on this show, even though I've been in Iowa almost seven years now, I don't know a lot about it. $2.8 billion. How big a deal is that in the grand scheme of things?",
